- the text explicitly says this neither makes DTS evidence nor imposes global monotonicity, and preserves resets, wraps, splices, epochs, signed ticks, and discontinuities;
- executable law ownership remains C1; first source-bearing reader remains D0 after admission; no FFmpeg code/dependency/runtime is authorized.

The plan, structural courts, C1 exit line, decision register, and append-only evolution note agree. I find no further amendment in this exact delta. This is supporting evidence only, not a policy review or substitute for the named component-ledger and Scout reviews.
